WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.377
Case file, Module two. On trial today: online fraud.

2
00:00:07.377 --> 00:00:11.734
Its favourite tools are easy money, and a voice that says hurry.

3
00:00:13.334 --> 00:00:19.461
Count one. A buyer sends you a QR code, to receive fifteen thousand rupees.

4
00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:25.937
But scanning a code, or typing your UPI PIN, only ever sends money out.

5
00:00:26.537 --> 00:00:31.537
Your PIN only ever sends money. It never brings money in.

6
00:00:33.137 --> 00:00:39.762
Count two. A message says your power will be cut tonight. Call this officer.

7
00:00:40.362 --> 00:00:47.302
The officer asks you to install an app. That app lets him see your screen, and your bank.

8
00:00:47.902 --> 00:00:51.687
Real companies never message you from a ten digit number.

9
00:00:53.287 --> 00:00:59.137
Count three. A part-time job: like a few videos, earn a hundred and fifty.

10
00:00:59.737 --> 00:01:09.016
Then, pay for VIP tasks. Arjun earned eight hundred and fifty on day one, and lost four point two lakh in two weeks.

11
00:01:09.616 --> 00:01:12.599
A job that asks you to pay is not a job.

12
00:01:13.999 --> 00:01:16.226
The verdict: guilty, every time.

13
00:01:17.826 --> 00:01:26.585
If you have lost money, do not wait. Stop paying, save the transaction ID, and call one nine three zero.
